---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy | The Royal House of Engagement" description="How Low Value Content handles storefront and order information.">
  <article class="plain-page">
    <header><p class="eyebrow">Effective November 21, 2026</p><h1>Privacy.</h1><p>Nelson Grey LLC operates Low Value Content. This notice describes information used to run the storefront and fulfill orders.</p></header>
    <div class="rows">
    <section><h2>Information used</h2><p>The cart stores product, variant, and quantity in your browser. When you order, Stripe collects payment, contact, and shipping details. We receive order details, contact and shipping information, payment status, and a Stripe payment reference; we do not receive your full card number. Our hosting provider may process IP address, browser, page, and timestamp data to deliver and secure the site.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Restricted environments</h2><p>Development and staging versions use Google and Firebase authentication. An authorized email address may be retained in session storage for the current browser session. This access gate is not used on the public production site.</p></section>
    <section><h2>How we use and share it</h2><p>We use order information to take payment, make and ship your shirt, show order status, resolve problems, prevent abuse, and meet recordkeeping obligations. Stripe processes checkout and payment; Printify receives the production and shipping details needed to fulfill an order; Google Firebase hosts the site and stores order status. Each provider processes information under its own terms and privacy notice.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Retention and choices</h2><p>Order records are kept as needed for fulfillment, support, disputes, tax and accounting obligations. You can clear the cart from your browser storage. To request access to or correction or deletion of information we control, email us; some records must be retained for legal or accounting reasons.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Contact</h2><p>For privacy questions, email <a href="mailto:support@lowvaluecontent.com">support@lowvaluecontent.com</a>.</p></section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
